          "message": "The default prefix for this inline formset comes from the FK accessor name, which is `childuuidpk_set`, not `child_set`. With the wrong prefix the management form data is missing, so the formset is invalid no matter what, and `assertIs(formset.is_valid(), False)` passes even without the fix. Use the correct prefix, or pass `prefix=`, and assert the specific error so the test actually checks the regression."
